%% Nested-subproject fixture — root self.glp.
%%
%% PURPOSE: sole coverage of the entry-point rule (modules.tex sec:static-linking
%% step 5, §External access): the program's entry points are the exported
%% procedures of the ROOT self.glp, here forwarded to the implementing module.
%% This root self.glp forwards `play` (to boot); the nested sub-project child/
%% has its OWN self.glp, so its `greet` is an entry point only when child/ is
%% itself the loaded root. No production project exercises both halves of this in
%% one tree — hence this minimal dedicated fixture.
imported procedure boot#play.
exported procedure play.
play :- boot # play.
